<title>UK: ANZ Bank appoints new South Asia debt specialist.</title>
<headline>ANZ Bank appoints new South Asia debt specialist.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ Investment Bank has appointed a new associate in the global structured finance group, the Australia and New Zealand Banking Group said in a statement.</p>
<p>Gaurav Seth will be responsible for working on the structuring of cross border debt products for South Asia. He will take over from Sandeep Dhawan who is moving as assistant director to the fixed income desk.</p>
<p>Seth will report to the director and head of specialist finance and global syndications in London, Chris Vermont.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
